<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-July building output drops 8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-July building output drops 8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The output of Hungary's building industry was down eight percent in the January-July period from the first seven months of last year, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Output in the January-July period was worth 197 billion forints, unadjusted to inflation, the KSH added.</p>
<p>Output in July dropped 1.2 percent from July 1995, the KSH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410</p>
